Day 20 – Report Generation and Data Export using Streamlit

Objective

The objective of Day 20 was to develop a report generation and data export module using Streamlit. The application enables users to download forecasting results, inventory optimization data, customer churn predictions, and a consolidated PDF report for business reporting and decision-making.

Dataset Overview

The application imported the following project datasets:

- Hybrid Forecast Results
- Inventory Optimization Results
- Customer Churn Predictions

These datasets were used to generate downloadable reports and summary documents.

Dataset Features

The exported datasets include information such as:

- Hybrid Demand Prediction
- Recommended Inventory
- Customer Churn Probability
- Business Performance Metrics

These features provide comprehensive insights into retail operations.

Data Preparation

The required CSV files were loaded using Pandas. The datasets were validated to ensure that the necessary information was available before generating reports and downloadable files.

Streamlit Report Module

A dedicated report generation interface was created using Streamlit. The application provides separate sections for exporting forecast data, inventory data, customer churn data, and a consolidated PDF report.

Forecast Data Export

The hybrid demand forecasting results were converted into CSV format and made available for download using Streamlit's download button functionality.

Inventory Data Export

The inventory optimization dataset was exported as a CSV file, allowing users to download inventory recommendations for further analysis and reporting.

Customer Churn Report

Customer churn prediction results were exported as a CSV file containing churn probabilities and customer-level prediction information.

PDF Report Generation

A PDF report was generated using the ReportLab library. The report summarized important business metrics, including:

- Total Forecast
- Average Recommended Inventory
- High-Risk Customers

The generated report provides a concise overview of project outcomes.

Download Functionality

Interactive download buttons were implemented within the Streamlit interface, enabling users to download CSV reports and the generated PDF report directly from the dashboard.

Key Findings

• Successfully imported forecasting, inventory, and customer churn datasets.
• Developed a Streamlit-based report generation module.
• Exported hybrid forecast results as a CSV report.
• Exported inventory optimization results as a CSV report.
• Exported customer churn predictions as a CSV report.
• Generated a consolidated PDF report using ReportLab.
• Implemented interactive download buttons for all reports.
• Simplified business reporting through automated report generation.

Conclusion

Day 20 focused on developing a report generation and data export module for the Retail Sales Forecasting project. The application successfully generated downloadable CSV files and a consolidated PDF report, enabling users to access forecasting results, inventory recommendations, and customer churn predictions in a convenient format. This module enhances business reporting, documentation, and decision-making by providing easy access to project outputs.